sults in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213417,"global_rank":245645,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":39177},{"name":"DavidMcLaughlin208/markov_chain","owner":"DavidMcLaughlin208","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidMcLaughlin208/markov_chain","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Practice in making a markov chain based text generator","topics":[],"score":213416,"global_rank":245665,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":39178},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://github.com/dlauritzen/SqlRest","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A super-thin MySQL REST API","topics":[],"score":213411,"global_rank":245668,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":39179},{"name":"ashleyknutsen/lmao","owner":"ashleyknutsen","html_url":"https://github.com/ashleyknutsen/lmao","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213402,"global_rank":245714,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":39180},{"name":"amritspandher/Avian-Influenza-Analysis","owner":"amritspandher","html_url":"https://github.com/amritspandher/Avian-Influenza-Analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"My ongoing analysis and trend report of the H5N1 virus in the United States (2022 - 2023).","topics":[],"score":213402,"global_rank":245719,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":39181},{"name":"csbuja/PGM_Inference_Alg_Comparison","owner":"csbuja","html_url":"https://github.com/csbuja/PGM_Inference_Alg_Comparison","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"https://dl.acm.org/cit